{"product_id":"mythos-mythos-1","title":"Mythos","description":"\u003cp\u003eThe Greek myths are amongst the best stories ever told, passed down through millennia and inspiring writers and artists as varied as Shakespeare, Michelangelo, James Joyce and Walt Disney.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\n\u003cp\u003eThey are embedded deeply in the traditions, tales and cultural DNA of the West. You'll fall in love with Zeus, marvel at the birth of Athena, wince at Cronus and Gaia's revenge on Ouranos, weep with King Midas and hunt with the beautiful and ferocious Artemis.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\n\u003cp\u003eSpellbinding, informative and moving, Stephen Fry's Mythos perfectly captures these stories for the modern age - in all their rich and deeply human relevance.\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 130 x 200\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Stephen Fry\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9781405934138\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Paperback\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 442\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookloopbook.com","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45823798804633,"sku":"17RD-1-9781405934138","price":20.0,"currency_code":"$","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/81PYI_VQduL._AC_UF1000_1000_QL80.jpg?v=1761324054","url":"https:\/\/bookloopbook.com\/products\/mythos-mythos-1","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}